# Copy to receptionist_team/.env -- main.py loads it itself with
# os.environ.setdefault (no python-dotenv in the venv), so an already
# exported value always wins.

# Required. Both receptionists' own conversational/routing replies and the
# dashboard's STT path read this.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Optional. Routes speech-to-text through the dashboard's Groq-backed pilot
# path (~1s) instead of local whisper.cpp (~25s on this CPU).
PIPECAT_PILOT_AGENT_ID=

# Optional. Overrides the profile's TTS voice, per receptionist:
# TOYOTA_EDGE_TTS_VOICE leaves the dashboard default (en-GB-SoniaNeural)
# when unset; Mazda's profile default is en-US-AriaNeural.
# MAZDA_EDGE_TTS_VOICE=en-US-AriaNeural

# Optional. Where Mickey looks for finance_reports/<year>/<month>/<account>.json
# and writes her snapshot. Defaults to receptionist_team/workspace/.
# MICKEY_REPO_ROOT=

# Optional, and the reason a spent Groq budget is no longer the end of the day.
# When set, each receptionist falls back to OpenAI after Groq refuses her
# model's 200000-tokens-per-day cap. Unset means Groq only, exactly as before.
#
# Use THIS name rather than the plain OPENAI_API_KEY. Only the fallback adapter
# reads it, and it is handed to the client explicitly -- so a key stored here
# cannot be picked up by openai_embedder.py (which constructs a bare OpenAI()
# and would otherwise bill a paid embedding run nobody asked for), nor by any
# other tool on this machine that looks for OPENAI_API_KEY.
#
# Nothing here touches Claude: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is the variable that silently
# flips Claude Code off subscription OAuth onto metered billing, and it must
# stay UNSET. An OpenAI key has no bearing on it, and neither has any bearing
# on a ChatGPT subscription -- API credits and subscriptions are separate
# systems that cannot spend each other's money.
# RECEPTIONIST_OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Which OpenAI model the fallback uses. Defaults to gpt-5-mini;
# --fallback-model overrides it for one run. Stick to a mini or larger -- a
# nano is the weight class that stopped obeying the ROUTE: rule. gpt-5.4-mini
# also works and is a little sharper, at three times the price.
# OPENAI_FALLBACK_MODEL=gpt-5-mini
